  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Climate and Resililence Programme Mekong Sub Region Imprest Number 8</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to protect the most vulnerable and marginalised children and their families from the impacts of climate change and disasters in the Mekong sub-region, through enhancing child-specific &amp; gender-sensitive data and evidence on climate and disaster risks and impact; strengthening technical and operational capacities of front-line government officials; and advancing exchange of knowledge, experiences and practices for action on climate and disaster resilience across the countries of the region.</narrative>
  </description>
